  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 20 as printed (昭和 8-13年度 six rows, 臺北州 新竹州 臺中州 臺南州 高雄州 臺東廳 花蓮港廳 澎湖廳, then 總督府, 交通局, 專賣局, 基隆稅關, 高雄稅關, 營林所). Table spans both pages: left page 502 (總額 .. 煙草收入, 7 columns) and right page 503 (酒及煙酒收入 .. 臺灣官設鐵道用品資金過剰金繰入, 9 columns); joined by row.",
   "Row label on the left page prints 官廳 over the letter-spaced names; the last six rows are written as 總督府 (printed 總督府), 交通局, 專賣局, 基隆稅關, 高雄稅關, 營林所 (printed with spaces: 總 督 府, 交 通 局, 專 賣 局, 營 林 所).",
   "Right-page title part '財產收入 (單位圓)' printed above the right-hand block, as the continuation of the title 官業及官有 on the left page; read as title 官業及官有財產收入.",
   "Unit 圓 (單位圓) printed after the title text on the right page; first column heading 官廳.",
   "Row '同 13年度', col 森林收入: printed '6 213 8?6' - the middle digit of the last group is 3 or 8 and unclear; written [?]. The sum of the 14 rows below is 6,213,887, which matches neither 836 nor 886 exactly (886 is within 1), so no rule applies. Row total 總額 132,582,065 minus the other 15 printed columns = 6,213,888.",
   "Column sums of the 14 rows (臺北州..營林所) against the 13年度 row reconcile exactly for every column except: 教科書收入 (printed 558,154, parts 558,153), 官有物貸下料 (printed 776,934, parts 776,932), and 森林收入 (cell [?]; parts 6,213,887).",
   "Row sums (all 15 component columns) equal 總額 for 昭和8 exactly; differences 1-2 in 同9, 同10, 同12, and for the area rows 臺中州 (-1), 高雄州 (+1), 臺東廳, 花蓮港廳, 澎湖廳(-1), 總督府, 交通局, 營林所 (+1) - rounding in the original. 昭和 11, 專賣局, 基隆稅關, 高雄稅關 reconcile exactly. 同13年度 row cannot be summed because of the [?].",
   "Cells alignment: 醫院收入 1,060,838, 度量衡收入 1,068,041, 刑務所收入 705,472 are on the 總督府 row; 酒及煙酒收入 27,623,924 on the 專賣局 row; 過剰金繰入 29 on the 交通局 row; read by y-position against the left-page row labels (14 rows after the year rows in all columns, checked in 官有物貸下料).",
   "Printed errata slip (正誤表, scan p0003), p. 502, 官[?] / [?]: printed '[?]' should read '[?]' (slip low-resolution; [?] = illegible on the slip). The figure is kept as printed in this table.",
   "Printed errata slip (正誤表, scan p0003), p. 503, footnote: printed '參照「[?]收入」' should read '[?] (slip reads: 參照「…」トアルハ「…」ノ誤)' (slip low-resolution; [?] = illegible on the slip). The figure is kept as printed in this table."
